(1118153, 137392, 20679, '<td valign="top">I really like the abstract fluidity of this shot. The colours are vibrant and the crop helps to draw the attention to the centre of the circle. Perhaps a tiny bit more post processing sharpening would help but on the other hand there is a softness to the shot that makes you  want to reach out and touch it. Excellent!  :)</td>', 'I really like the abstract fluidity of this shot. The colours are vibrant and the crop helps to draw the attention to the centre of the circle. Perhaps a tiny bit more post processing sharpening would help but on the other hand there is a softness to the shot that makes you  want to reach out and touch it. Excellent!  :)', '2005-01-19 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
