(1118339, 137088, 19408, '<td valign="top">just some comments not criticisms. i like the kids triangular stance. thr triangle within the circle create nice geometric shapes. A lower perspective more eye level might create a better connection with the subject. I''m thinking a little tighter crop would bring the kid out more. Shallower DOF to blur background. These all may detract though from your intended(?) "down the barrel" look. It''s good though. NIce work!</td>', 'just some comments not criticisms. i like the kids triangular stance. thr triangle within the circle create nice geometric shapes. A lower perspective more eye level might create a better connection with the subject. I''m thinking a little tighter crop would bring the kid out more. Shallower DOF to blur background. These all may detract though from your intended(?) "down the barrel" look. It''s good though. NIce work!', '2005-01-19 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
