(1119514, 137447, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great use of food dye!<br/>I''ve tried shots like this before but couldn''t manage to get such detailed drops of the dye. I''m wondering if you used something other than water as your liquid... looking forward to reading the explanation of this one :)</td>', 'Great use of food dye!I''ve tried shots like this before but couldn''t manage to get such detailed drops of the dye. I''m wondering if you used something other than water as your liquid... looking forward to reading the explanation of this one :)', '2005-01-19 15:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119517, 135947, 17507, '<td valign="top">Most impressive shot- but without some clue in the title, it''s hard for me to feel like this really meets the challenge. Too bad you didn''t take this during a free study week!</td>', 'Most impressive shot- but without some clue in the title, it''s hard for me to feel like this really meets the challenge. Too bad you didn''t take this during a free study week!', '2005-01-19 15:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119519, 135658, 17507, '<td valign="top">Interesting experiment with low resolution. I think it works well here. I''m curious to know what you did to get that warped effect while still within the bounds of basic editing.</td>', 'Interesting experiment with low resolution. I think it works well here. I''m curious to know what you did to get that warped effect while still within the bounds of basic editing.', '2005-01-19 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119521, 137358, 32041, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and grainy.</td>', 'Out of focus and grainy.', '2005-01-19 15:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119523, 137290, 17507, '<td valign="top">The loop around the arm of the chair gives a good sense of depth and three-dimensionality. Nice touch.</td>', 'The loop around the arm of the chair gives a good sense of depth and three-dimensionality. Nice touch.', '2005-01-19 15:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119525, 137372, 17507, '<td valign="top">In some ways, this bears a remarkable similarity to my submission, but I''m sure we took pictures of different things. You''ve got me here. My best guess is some kind of slime mold. I just wish the focus were a bit sharper.</td>', 'In some ways, this bears a remarkable similarity to my submission, but I''m sure we took pictures of different things. You''ve got me here. My best guess is some kind of slime mold. I just wish the focus were a bit sharper.', '2005-01-19 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119529, 137790, 17507, '<td valign="top">Done in basic editing..? How can this be..!?@</td>', 'Done in basic editing..? How can this be..!?@', '2005-01-19 16:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119532, 137691, 25952, '<td valign="top">beautiful winter scene.</td>', 'beautiful winter scene.', '2005-01-19 16:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119534, 136288, 17507, '<td valign="top">You like this technique, don''t you :)<br/>Great job with it- the positions of your head are remarkably symmetrical  and the exposure is  very good. But since I''ve seen a number of your other pictures with this sort of setup it''s unfortunately pretty clear that this is a refinement of a technique you have already used, not something new.<br/> <br/>One of the drawbacks of having a distinct style, I suppose :)</td>', 'You like this technique, don''t you :)Great job with it- the positions of your head are remarkably symmetrical  and the exposure is  very good. But since I''ve seen a number of your other pictures with this sort of setup it''s unfortunately pretty clear that this is a refinement of a technique you have already used, not something new. One of the drawbacks of having a distinct style, I suppose :)', '2005-01-19 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119536, 137820, 16739, '<td valign="top">must be scalvert</td>', 'must be scalvert', '2005-01-19 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119537, 137792, 32041, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for a personal challenge.  The background is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice concept for a personal challenge.  The background is a little distracting.', '2005-01-19 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119542, 136654, 32041, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think there were supposed to be words in the challenges.  If the photo was by itself I would have given a higher rating.</td>', 'I didn''t think there were supposed to be words in the challenges.  If the photo was by itself I would have given a higher rating.', '2005-01-19 16:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119545, 137819, 22537, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject though I''m having a difficult time seeing what it is.  I suspect it may be a ceiling lamp. Good perspective and color. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting subject though I''m having a difficult time seeing what it is.  I suspect it may be a ceiling lamp. Good perspective and color. Good luck.', '2005-01-19 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
