(1119556, 137797, 22537, '<td valign="top">This shot has a menacing and cold feel about it.  The stark shift between light and dark adds to the effect.  I suspect this is a factory of sort and you have transformed it into a mechanical beast. I really like how you have made something unitnteresting rather captivating.  Good luck!</td>', 'This shot has a menacing and cold feel about it.  The stark shift between light and dark adds to the effect.  I suspect this is a factory of sort and you have transformed it into a mechanical beast. I really like how you have made something unitnteresting rather captivating.  Good luck!', '2005-01-19 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
