(1119601, 137749, 20679, '<td valign="top">This is very effective and extremely well done. If we have to get pick, I suppose the glare of the lights, especially the one at 11 o''clock, is rather distracting. If we could spot edit you could get rid of it, but this is a lovely shot anyway. 8</td>', 'This is very effective and extremely well done. If we have to get pick, I suppose the glare of the lights, especially the one at 11 o''clock, is rather distracting. If we could spot edit you could get rid of it, but this is a lovely shot anyway. 8', '2005-01-19 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
