(1119611, 136734, 20679, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique - like the high key effect and the way it fades to white.  Makes a high contrast image more interesting like this although compositionally I think a lower viewpoint might have been better so the bridge doesn''t dissect the telescope.</td>', 'Interesting technique - like the high key effect and the way it fades to white.  Makes a high contrast image more interesting like this although compositionally I think a lower viewpoint might have been better so the bridge doesn''t dissect the telescope.', '2005-01-19 16:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
