(1121841, 136220, 11270, '<td valign="top">like the darkness, and strong shadows, it works well in black and white. Is it plymouth hoe?? looks the same...will check it out when the challenge is done...well done 8</td>', 'like the darkness, and strong shadows, it works well in black and white. Is it plymouth hoe?? looks the same...will check it out when the challenge is done...well done 8', '2005-01-20 17:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
