(1121949, 136408, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t believe i''m seeing this...this was my entry up until 11:55pm.  i just couldn''t go through with it.  i''ll have to give you a 10 just for showing the courage!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=136299" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/136299.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/136299.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/136299.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-26 07:38:05.</i></td>', 'i don''t believe i''m seeing this...this was my entry up until 11:55pm.  i just couldn''t go through with it.  i''ll have to give you a 10 just for showing the courage! ', '2005-01-20 18:04:35.000000', '2005-01-26 07:38:05.000000', 1),
(1121951, 137381, 23394, '<td valign="top">looks like somebody was having fun....  nice job with the lighting and focus.</td>', 'looks like somebody was having fun....  nice job with the lighting and focus.', '2005-01-20 18:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121959, 137813, 22538, '<td valign="top">or A bridge too far? Intriguing shot.</td>', 'or A bridge too far? Intriguing shot.', '2005-01-20 18:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121966, 137358, 32079, '<td valign="top">i think if there was less noise in the picture this would be better</td>', 'i think if there was less noise in the picture this would be better', '2005-01-20 18:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122010, 136795, 4007, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that the top of the stairs (bottom of the photo) draws the most attention to itself here, but the focus here is substantially farther out so that the nearer portion is unsatisfyingly blurry.</td>', 'It seems to me that the top of the stairs (bottom of the photo) draws the most attention to itself here, but the focus here is substantially farther out so that the nearer portion is unsatisfyingly blurry.', '2005-01-20 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122014, 137822, 4007, '<td valign="top">The effect on the mouth area is a bit unsettling and interesting at least, but the consequence of the rest of the face having no sharpness at all (from the incidental movement) is far too big of a problem to be ignored.</td>', 'The effect on the mouth area is a bit unsettling and interesting at least, but the consequence of the rest of the face having no sharpness at all (from the incidental movement) is far too big of a problem to be ignored.', '2005-01-20 19:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122015, 137794, 4007, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I''ll bet it''d look even better if you maxed out your picture''s dimensions to the allowed 640 width.</td>', 'Neat idea.  I''ll bet it''d look even better if you maxed out your picture''s dimensions to the allowed 640 width.', '2005-01-20 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122021, 137816, 4007, '<td valign="top">Those feet are positioned at the point horizontally where they aren''t quite centered, but they''re so close it almost feels like they were supposed to be centered. It''s just a bit of an awkward spot to put your subject in, and without a specific reason for framing it that way, you''d probably be better off making it symetrical or more to one side.<br/>I like the shot on the whole though.  Very simple yet engaging and visually interesting.</td>', 'Those feet are positioned at the point horizontally where they aren''t quite centered, but they''re so close it almost feels like they were supposed to be centered. It''s just a bit of an awkward spot to put your subject in, and without a specific reason for framing it that way, you''d probably be better off making it symetrical or more to one side.I like the shot on the whole though.  Very simple yet engaging and visually interesting.', '2005-01-20 19:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122024, 137724, 4007, '<td valign="top">Maybe it seems tedius, but you established certain color patterns here, and having two of the faces done in pink when no other colors are replicated is a little awkward.  It would even work better if the purple guy had a green face, because symetry patterns could justify having the same color twice.  <br/> <br/>And now I feel very OCD after making this comment.<br/>Fun shot.  Good luck to you.</td>', 'Maybe it seems tedius, but you established certain color patterns here, and having two of the faces done in pink when no other colors are replicated is a little awkward.  It would even work better if the purple guy had a green face, because symetry patterns could justify having the same color twice.   And now I feel very OCD after making this comment.Fun shot.  Good luck to you.', '2005-01-20 19:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122028, 137381, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot minus the second (from the left) exposure would come off much more cleanly, but the overlapping of the two at left comes out (at least to me) as muddled and distracting rather than interesting.</td>', 'This shot minus the second (from the left) exposure would come off much more cleanly, but the overlapping of the two at left comes out (at least to me) as muddled and distracting rather than interesting.', '2005-01-20 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
