(1122977, 135867, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is nice and there are two ways to accomplish it. Well actually three ways. First, a simple time exposre and then clicking the light on. Second, another time exposure but allowing the flash to go off and while the shutter is open clicking on the light. Third by using a manual strobe. You begin the exposure, trigger the strobe and while shutter is open click on the light. Done with a flash or stobe gives better color satutarion.  Regardless, you have the principle down. Bumping up on good effort.</td>', 'This is nice and there are two ways to accomplish it. Well actually three ways. First, a simple time exposre and then clicking the light on. Second, another time exposure but allowing the flash to go off and while the shutter is open clicking on the light. Third by using a manual strobe. You begin the exposure, trigger the strobe and while shutter is open click on the light. Done with a flash or stobe gives better color satutarion.  Regardless, you have the principle down. Bumping up on good effort.', '2005-01-21 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122984, 137119, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very creative light painting presentation with super comp properties. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very creative light painting presentation with super comp properties. Bumping up.', '2005-01-21 08:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122990, 137375, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting effect. Another way to enhance it is by having a third hand quickly move a piece of semi transparant acetate right in front of the flame. This allows a higher definition of the transiting colors in the flame. However, your image is direct and to the point. Good capture. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very interesting effect. Another way to enhance it is by having a third hand quickly move a piece of semi transparant acetate right in front of the flame. This allows a higher definition of the transiting colors in the flame. However, your image is direct and to the point. Good capture. Bumping up.', '2005-01-21 09:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
