(1123234, 137618, 22734, '<td valign="top">A nice panning effect with a different twist: It is easy to pan a moving object such as a car or someone running. Here you had to contrive the scene which can be done in two ways. One is to station woody and move a background, such as poster board or image. The other is by attaching an extension to base of camera. This extension would then hold woody and he can be panned anywhere. Well done and bumping up.</td>', 'A nice panning effect with a different twist: It is easy to pan a moving object such as a car or someone running. Here you had to contrive the scene which can be done in two ways. One is to station woody and move a background, such as poster board or image. The other is by attaching an extension to base of camera. This extension would then hold woody and he can be panned anywhere. Well done and bumping up.', '2005-01-21 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
