(1123468, 136437, 14476, '<td valign="top">There have been several "live concert" images in this Challenge and I think yours is the best.  You''ve interpreted the performer''s movements and integrated them into the surroundings, rather than taking a static pose/portrait.  Well done.  10</td>', 'There have been several "live concert" images in this Challenge and I think yours is the best.  You''ve interpreted the performer''s movements and integrated them into the surroundings, rather than taking a static pose/portrait.  Well done.  10', '2005-01-21 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
