(1123773, 137652, 20168, '<td valign="top">The only hesitation I have for top marks is the question "How does this photo ''break new ground''"?  I suppose direct exposure into the sun demands groundbreaking use of lenses, filters and such.  Nonetheless, the photo is quietly gorgeous, the most beautiful landscape photo of this challenge.</td>', 'The only hesitation I have for top marks is the question "How does this photo ''break new ground''"?  I suppose direct exposure into the sun demands groundbreaking use of lenses, filters and such.  Nonetheless, the photo is quietly gorgeous, the most beautiful landscape photo of this challenge.', '2005-01-21 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123776, 137660, 20168, '<td valign="top">Stunning use of lighting, exposure and color for an abstract piece of art.  10</td>', 'Stunning use of lighting, exposure and color for an abstract piece of art.  10', '2005-01-21 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123783, 137515, 20168, '<td valign="top">In my profession, I work with people who grieve almost weekly.  This photo evokes the memory of those passed on, including the black/white, old world grainy quality of the photo, which some DPC folks may be tempted to vote down simply due to these photographic qualities which work so well to enhance the photo.  10</td>', 'In my profession, I work with people who grieve almost weekly.  This photo evokes the memory of those passed on, including the black/white, old world grainy quality of the photo, which some DPC folks may be tempted to vote down simply due to these photographic qualities which work so well to enhance the photo.  10', '2005-01-21 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123784, 137803, 20168, '<td valign="top">I too attempted light painting for this challenge but didn''t come even close to the coolness of this image.  Great presentation and creativity!  10</td>', 'I too attempted light painting for this challenge but didn''t come even close to the coolness of this image.  Great presentation and creativity!  10', '2005-01-21 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123788, 135727, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and presentation, even in the blurry quality of the photo, the candid aspect which adds authority to the image and calls on that common human experience of saying goodbye, whether to the family dog or to a person we love.  Excellent way to "break new ground".  10</td>', 'Cool idea and presentation, even in the blurry quality of the photo, the candid aspect which adds authority to the image and calls on that common human experience of saying goodbye, whether to the family dog or to a person we love.  Excellent way to "break new ground".  10', '2005-01-21 16:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123791, 137429, 20168, '<td valign="top">All of us are thinking, "no way".  We had no idea that DPC fans live on the international space station.  We''ll look forward to hearing your story.  Great exposure of the celestial realm.  "The heavens declare the glory of God, the skies proclaim the work of His hands!"  10</td>', 'All of us are thinking, "no way".  We had no idea that DPC fans live on the international space station.  We''ll look forward to hearing your story.  Great exposure of the celestial realm.  "The heavens declare the glory of God, the skies proclaim the work of His hands!"  10', '2005-01-21 16:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
