(1123799, 137119, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great use of light painting technique, the best in this "breaking new ground" challenge.  The human behind the scene adds that above and beyond quality to this photo, a strange mix of vulnerability, pain and ecstasy, all of which are sure signs of the difficult yet rewarding work of peacemaking.  10</td>', 'Great use of light painting technique, the best in this "breaking new ground" challenge.  The human behind the scene adds that above and beyond quality to this photo, a strange mix of vulnerability, pain and ecstasy, all of which are sure signs of the difficult yet rewarding work of peacemaking.  10', '2005-01-21 16:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123805, 136437, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent groundbreaking image, a candid looking shot which evokes the passion and power of a live music performance.  The image seems fishbowled, likely intentionally to suggest that quality of all live "in concert" people who live their personal lives on stage before crowds.  10</td>', 'Excellent groundbreaking image, a candid looking shot which evokes the passion and power of a live music performance.  The image seems fishbowled, likely intentionally to suggest that quality of all live "in concert" people who live their personal lives on stage before crowds.  10', '2005-01-21 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
