(1125489, 137717, 10626, '<td valign="top">There are many things that can be improved in this photo. Composition it''s the first one. I wouldn''t have cut the sun, the horizon it''s sided to the left, and in the bottom left corner there''s a pice of something that shouldn''t be there. <br/>To avoid the excesive reflex of light use a polarizer filter, u don''t need to have a SRL camera to use one. <br/>Practice makes experts. :D</td>', 'There are many things that can be improved in this photo. Composition it''s the first one. I wouldn''t have cut the sun, the horizon it''s sided to the left, and in the bottom left corner there''s a pice of something that shouldn''t be there. To avoid the excesive reflex of light use a polarizer filter, u don''t need to have a SRL camera to use one. Practice makes experts. :D', '2005-01-22 15:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125493, 137820, 10626, '<td valign="top">Good work</td>', 'Good work', '2005-01-22 15:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
