(1125507, 137643, 7485, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to perceive the foreground object as a knife and even longer to get the face. The concept is quite something and the time taken to perceive the elements is well spent. My only suggestion is that if the knife were better lit (and in razor-sharp focus), the image would carry much more impact - 8</td>', 'Took me a while to perceive the foreground object as a knife and even longer to get the face. The concept is quite something and the time taken to perceive the elements is well spent. My only suggestion is that if the knife were better lit (and in razor-sharp focus), the image would carry much more impact - 8', '2005-01-22 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125509, 137691, 14614, '<td valign="top">amazing! great eye for composition, use of color and light.  one of my ribbon picks this challenge and going in my favorites</td>', 'amazing! great eye for composition, use of color and light.  one of my ribbon picks this challenge and going in my favorites', '2005-01-22 15:28:14.000000', NULL, 1);
