(1127445, 137639, 7485, '<td valign="top">I would probably have gone with either a higher viewing angle (separating the foreground plants completely from the background) or even better, a lower angle (so the plants crossed the horizon). The plants also looks a little over-sharpened. But fog is always a great subject!</td>', 'I would probably have gone with either a higher viewing angle (separating the foreground plants completely from the background) or even better, a lower angle (so the plants crossed the horizon). The plants also looks a little over-sharpened. But fog is always a great subject!', '2005-01-23 18:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
