(1128024, 137381, 31664, '<td valign="top">Strobe is not a ground breaking technique by its self, but I think you''ve put more into it to so that it fit the challenge nicely.  You''ve used the strobe to create a true portrait that convays emotion the way a single shot wouldn''t.  Well done, you got my first 10 for the challenge.</td>', 'Strobe is not a ground breaking technique by its self, but I think you''ve put more into it to so that it fit the challenge nicely.  You''ve used the strobe to create a true portrait that convays emotion the way a single shot wouldn''t.  Well done, you got my first 10 for the challenge.', '2005-01-23 23:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128029, 137229, 14193, '<td valign="top">Clearly, since there is a note at the bottom of this picture that it has been validated, I am not the only one saying "how is this possible in basic editing?" Very cool, I am anxious to see how you did this. I hope it gets a ribbon, it has my vote! :)</td>', 'Clearly, since there is a note at the bottom of this picture that it has been validated, I am not the only one saying "how is this possible in basic editing?" Very cool, I am anxious to see how you did this. I hope it gets a ribbon, it has my vote! :)', '2005-01-23 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128037, 137621, 31664, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve used the harsh outside light to create the stark contrast on hi face.  For me it fits the theme, its both doing something different but still achive a astetically pleasing result 10</td>', 'I like the way you''ve used the harsh outside light to create the stark contrast on hi face.  For me it fits the theme, its both doing something different but still achive a astetically pleasing result 10', '2005-01-23 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
