(1128527, 137820, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great idea, execution and technique. this will surely be up the top somewhere. My only criticism is the green band behind the boy. It''s a bit weird and could have been more effective if this looked more tangible or recognisable. Crop is a bit tight to the ball, but otherwise it''s great.</td>', 'Great idea, execution and technique. this will surely be up the top somewhere. My only criticism is the green band behind the boy. It''s a bit weird and could have been more effective if this looked more tangible or recognisable. Crop is a bit tight to the ball, but otherwise it''s great.', '2005-01-24 04:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128529, 136288, 8860, '<td valign="top">Slick execution - effective colour. Don''t like the title though (will annoy after the challenge!). I''d like to have seen some purpose to matching the expressions with colour/mood, ie: anger, envy, sad?</td>', 'Slick execution - effective colour. Don''t like the title though (will annoy after the challenge!). I''d like to have seen some purpose to matching the expressions with colour/mood, ie: anger, envy, sad?', '2005-01-24 04:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
