(1128978, 136236, 22734, '<td valign="top">"One eye commentator":<br/>You are certainly on the right track. A real face here would have raised the competative edge of this image. But hey, you have the technique. Bumping up on cool effort.</td>', '"One eye commentator":You are certainly on the right track. A real face here would have raised the competative edge of this image. But hey, you have the technique. Bumping up on cool effort.', '2005-01-24 11:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128982, 136037, 22734, '<td valign="top">"One eye commentator":<br/>A very interesting effect. On future efforts I recommend painting the eyelashes real black. Adding black to the nostrils and wearing a colorful bowtie. The effect is cool. Bumping up.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-26 08:36:02.</i></td>', '"One eye commentator":A very interesting effect. On future efforts I recommend painting the eyelashes real black. Adding black to the nostrils and wearing a colorful bowtie. The effect is cool. Bumping up.', '2005-01-24 11:17:14.000000', '2005-01-26 08:36:02.000000', 1),
