(1130013, 137744, 32588, '<td valign="top">i was just talking to the friend that referred me to dpchallenge.com about the photography of motion.  he says he doesn''t much like blurry photographs except in a gallery of similar styles, so they have a context.  (this seems to be the popular opinion.)  i, however, LOVE blatant movement, and this is probably the best i''ve seen it done in a while.  nice job.</td>', 'i was just talking to the friend that referred me to dpchallenge.com about the photography of motion.  he says he doesn''t much like blurry photographs except in a gallery of similar styles, so they have a context.  (this seems to be the popular opinion.)  i, however, LOVE blatant movement, and this is probably the best i''ve seen it done in a while.  nice job.', '2005-01-24 22:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
