(1131263, 137691, 31133, '<td valign="top">The colors and shades of white and gray in this picture, combined with the sharpness of the foreground and fog so soft I can feel it make this the best I''ve seen in this challenge so far. The only thing I don''t like is the frame, but I''m not taking points away for that. 10<br/>Also, I think your title is perfect.</td>', 'The colors and shades of white and gray in this picture, combined with the sharpness of the foreground and fog so soft I can feel it make this the best I''ve seen in this challenge so far. The only thing I don''t like is the frame, but I''m not taking points away for that. 10Also, I think your title is perfect.', '2005-01-25 16:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
