(1131661, 137426, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt of an abstract macro. Few suggestions: needs better focus, adjust the exposure so the highlights are not blown out, simplify the white thin line - it''s a bit fuzzy. Also try differently coloured lights (even flashlight with gell) to cast some more life into the image. Good try though.</td>', 'Nice attempt of an abstract macro. Few suggestions: needs better focus, adjust the exposure so the highlights are not blown out, simplify the white thin line - it''s a bit fuzzy. Also try differently coloured lights (even flashlight with gell) to cast some more life into the image. Good try though.', '2005-01-25 19:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131663, 137403, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice focus and blur on the sides. Suggestion: crop off a bit on the right side for better composition.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice focus and blur on the sides. Suggestion: crop off a bit on the right side for better composition.', '2005-01-25 19:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131665, 137660, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and colour, great simple background, great light, although the crop/composition is not as appealing.</td>', 'Nice abstract and colour, great simple background, great light, although the crop/composition is not as appealing.', '2005-01-25 19:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131668, 137290, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Like the colours. Try different composition and viewpoint for greater results.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Like the colours. Try different composition and viewpoint for greater results.', '2005-01-25 19:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131672, 137804, 10275, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of negative space, although here you have a way too much of it. This photo would benefit from a tighter crop. The exposure is right on, love the monotoneness. The uneven border takes away from the simplicity of the photo tough.</td>', 'I am a fan of negative space, although here you have a way too much of it. This photo would benefit from a tighter crop. The exposure is right on, love the monotoneness. The uneven border takes away from the simplicity of the photo tough.', '2005-01-25 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131678, 136116, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:03:42.</i></td>', 'z', '2005-01-25 19:50:07.000000', '2005-07-12 09:03:42.000000', 1),
(1131680, 136970, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. Love the glowing colour. The "bull eye" composition is really what takes away from this photo. Perhaps you could try a different crop. If you divide the photo into equal quarters, I can see a great image in the bottom left quarter or even the bottom right quarter by itself.</td>', 'Great abstract. Love the glowing colour. The "bull eye" composition is really what takes away from this photo. Perhaps you could try a different crop. If you divide the photo into equal quarters, I can see a great image in the bottom left quarter or even the bottom right quarter by itself.', '2005-01-25 19:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131686, 137067, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Unusual hues. Nice complimenting border. The tree seems out of focus and you probably tried to compensate by oversharpening - hence the hallo effect around the branches.</td>', 'Great subject. Unusual hues. Nice complimenting border. The tree seems out of focus and you probably tried to compensate by oversharpening - hence the hallo effect around the branches.', '2005-01-25 19:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131691, 137407, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice IR image. Great sharpness. The highlights are a bit blown out and there is a lot of colour noise in the background. Have you tried this as a b&amp;w image - that would have reduced the noise. You can actually convert this into grey scale and then apply colour like sepia or other tones virtually eliminating colour noise.</td>', 'Nice IR image. Great sharpness. The highlights are a bit blown out and there is a lot of colour noise in the background. Have you tried this as a b&w image - that would have reduced the noise. You can actually convert this into grey scale and then apply colour like sepia or other tones virtually eliminating colour noise.', '2005-01-25 19:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131695, 136288, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-12 08:03:25.</i></td>', 'z', '2005-01-25 19:56:17.000000', '2005-07-12 09:03:25.000000', 1),
(1131696, 137406, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. Lovely warm colour and nice clean border. Although the border (if the same colour as the warmer tones in the animal) could have been better compliment.</td>', 'Nice effect. Lovely warm colour and nice clean border. Although the border (if the same colour as the warmer tones in the animal) could have been better compliment.', '2005-01-25 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131699, 135841, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice technique. Makes for good abstract photo. Although less is often more. I would have cropped the image in half - the left half is more interesting. You can actually have several different images out of this single one.</td>', 'Nice technique. Makes for good abstract photo. Although less is often more. I would have cropped the image in half - the left half is more interesting. You can actually have several different images out of this single one.', '2005-01-25 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131702, 137447, 22734, '<td valign="top">A definite winner to tease the senses with ink and water. Another bump!</td>', 'A definite winner to tease the senses with ink and water. Another bump!', '2005-01-25 20:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131717, 136203, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract effect with a nice background. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract effect with a nice background. Bumping up.', '2005-01-25 20:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
