(1131727, 137429, 27293, '<td valign="top">PRetty cool, although it looks more like an experiment, rather than a finished product. I would still be curious to see how this was done. I hope it''s not a shot of a monitor or something to that extent.</td>', 'PRetty cool, although it looks more like an experiment, rather than a finished product. I would still be curious to see how this was done. I hope it''s not a shot of a monitor or something to that extent.', '2005-01-25 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
