(1132201, 137820, 23394, '<td valign="top">and skippy nails another one (it only took me 27 minutes to ID his shot)!  great work, absolutely great work, shannon!  congrats!<br/> <br/>and, btw, i don''t think most people realize JUST HOW HARD YOU HAD TO WORK AT THIS to make this image happen!  it goes a quite a bit beyond what''s in the liner notes, so far...like how many clicks it took to get it just right!  if this was any other child, they''d be after him for breaking child labor laws...LOL<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-26 00:10:15.</i></td>', 'and skippy nails another one (it only took me 27 minutes to ID his shot)!  great work, absolutely great work, shannon!  congrats! and, btw, i don''t think most people realize JUST HOW HARD YOU HAD TO WORK AT THIS to make this image happen!  it goes a quite a bit beyond what''s in the liner notes, so far...like how many clicks it took to get it just right!  if this was any other child, they''d be after him for breaking child labor laws...LOL', '2005-01-26 00:07:01.000000', '2005-01-26 00:10:15.000000', 0),
(1132204, 137820, 20375, '<td valign="top">I admire your ingenuity. Great shot. I''ve seen you use "fake walls" in some of your other shots....gonna have to take a lesson from you.<br/>Congrats on the ribbon!<br/>Always nice when one of my favourites wins.<br/> <br/>Regards, <br/>Randy<br/>P.S. thx for the christmas wishes!</td>', 'I admire your ingenuity. Great shot. I''ve seen you use "fake walls" in some of your other shots....gonna have to take a lesson from you.Congrats on the ribbon!Always nice when one of my favourites wins. Regards, RandyP.S. thx for the christmas wishes!', '2005-01-26 00:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
