(1132220, 137229, 10080, '<td valign="top">Just a great idea! I appreciate not only your ingenuity, and creativity, but also your dedication to constructivly critiquing your contemporaries photographs. I have NEVER typed a sentence with more syllables, WOW! Great shot and thanks! I wish you the best! WONDERFUL PHOTOGRAPH!<br/>P.S. I never realized I spelled so bad?</td>', 'Just a great idea! I appreciate not only your ingenuity, and creativity, but also your dedication to constructivly critiquing your contemporaries photographs. I have NEVER typed a sentence with more syllables, WOW! Great shot and thanks! I wish you the best! WONDERFUL PHOTOGRAPH!P.S. I never realized I spelled so bad?', '2005-01-26 00:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
