(1132868, 136230, 6948, '<td valign="top">Thank all of you for your comments! :-D<br/>Some of you have mentioned that the pic is slihgtly off balance... I noticed that, and I thought that it''s not so bad. Infact, I mean that it creates mood like you''re standing right there.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by graphicfunk:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your red. Here you used what is available to all. Of course, your accomplishment is to be highly extolled because your image is as pure as the pristine snow and what drove it to ribbon in the midst of so much bng material, is the sheer force of beauty. It is an image that weaves the feelings and senses with magic. Extremely outstanding! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you very much! I really appreciate that you like my picture!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-26 08:20:05.</i></td>', 'Thank all of you for your comments! :-DSome of you have mentioned that the pic is slihgtly off balance... I noticed that, and I thought that it''s not so bad. Infact, I mean that it creates mood like you''re standing right there.Originally posted by graphicfunk: Congratulations on your red. Here you used what is available to all. Of course, your accomplishment is to be highly extolled because your image is as pure as the pristine snow and what drove it to ribbon in the midst of so much bng material, is the sheer force of beauty. It is an image that weaves the feelings and senses with magic. Extremely outstanding!  Thank you very much! I really appreciate that you like my picture!', '2005-01-26 08:19:40.000000', '2005-01-26 08:20:05.000000', 0),
