(1132885, 137447, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey lawrence: Another great one from your arsenal and boy are there more where this comes from. Your creativity is unique and this is a dashing and outstanding effort. Congratulations on your top ten finish.</td>', 'Hey lawrence: Another great one from your arsenal and boy are there more where this comes from. Your creativity is unique and this is a dashing and outstanding effort. Congratulations on your top ten finish.', '2005-01-26 08:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1132890, 137119, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nico: This is an exceptional creative light painting. One of the best I have seen because of the cool balance between subject and light. You are quite a creative young man. Keep it up and keep outdoing yourself.</td>', 'Nico: This is an exceptional creative light painting. One of the best I have seen because of the cool balance between subject and light. You are quite a creative young man. Keep it up and keep outdoing yourself.', '2005-01-26 08:28:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1132892, 137381, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey Jon: Congratulations on your top 10 finish. This is certainly an outstanding example of multiple exposure with lots of character. Taking this as one of my favs.</td>', 'Hey Jon: Congratulations on your top 10 finish. This is certainly an outstanding example of multiple exposure with lots of character. Taking this as one of my favs.', '2005-01-26 08:30:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1132907, 137229, 17377, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another well thought out photograph!!!!</td>', 'Congrats on another well thought out photograph!!!!', '2005-01-26 08:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1132908, 137820, 22970, '<td valign="top">Scalvert first let me congratulate you on your blue ribbon and say it was well deserved. I did not get to vote in the challenge because of time reasons but this has to be one of many very creative photographs in the challenge. I just want to say thanks for taking the extra effort to put together a nice illusion photograph and describing with pictures how you achieved the out come. I''m not taking away from any of the other photographers because there were many that did a great job as well but yours [after looking through the entries] stood out on top for me. Again Congratulations and I know you will see more blue in the future with the efforts you put forth in your entries. And to all others that did the same congrats as well. I''m reminded of something someone once told me, "you can''t be jealous of what someone has unless you are willing to do what they did to get it". I think this is a good example of that. My first though was, "man I wish I could do this type of work", then I realized I could if I tried in the same capacity as you did. Thank you for a fine piece of work.<br/>Scott W.</td>', 'Scalvert first let me congratulate you on your blue ribbon and say it was well deserved. I did not get to vote in the challenge because of time reasons but this has to be one of many very creative photographs in the challenge. I just want to say thanks for taking the extra effort to put together a nice illusion photograph and describing with pictures how you achieved the out come. I''m not taking away from any of the other photographers because there were many that did a great job as well but yours [after looking through the entries] stood out on top for me. Again Congratulations and I know you will see more blue in the future with the efforts you put forth in your entries. And to all others that did the same congrats as well. I''m reminded of something someone once told me, "you can''t be jealous of what someone has unless you are willing to do what they did to get it". I think this is a good example of that. My first though was, "man I wish I could do this type of work", then I realized I could if I tried in the same capacity as you did. Thank you for a fine piece of work.Scott W.', '2005-01-26 08:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1132912, 137813, 31895, '<td valign="top">good job!<br/>did u get my email with a few of my pics? let me know what you thought. Dagmara</td>', 'good job!did u get my email with a few of my pics? let me know what you thought. Dagmara', '2005-01-26 08:52:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1132940, 137534, 23621, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite! Wish it had scored better!! :( I get it, I love it, don''t change a thing!!! don''t let em get you down!!!</td>', 'This was my favorite! Wish it had scored better!! :( I get it, I love it, don''t change a thing!!! don''t let em get you down!!!', '2005-01-26 09:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
