(1132969, 137776, 13688, '<td valign="top">This reminded me of the style of another artist, but not from photography...Picasso perhaps?  Anyway, I found this an amazing shot, very innovative (as far as I know) and my favorite of the challenge.  It pains me this wasn''t more well received.</td>', 'This reminded me of the style of another artist, but not from photography...Picasso perhaps?  Anyway, I found this an amazing shot, very innovative (as far as I know) and my favorite of the challenge.  It pains me this wasn''t more well received.', '2005-01-26 09:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
