(1132994, 137457, 32111, '<td valign="top">Don''t be disheartened by this! I just think that people saw the ''new'' part of this as relating to the subject''s blue nose, not the photographic style in which the picture was taken. In a different challenge, this would probably attract a higher score.<br/> <br/>You are obviously fond of capturing bold colour - I particularly like the bucket/mustard experiment. This pic fits in with that, and I hope future ones will too.<br/> <br/>At the end of the day, take the photos because you enjoy doing it, not because they appeal to someone else, reassuring as that can be.</td>', 'Don''t be disheartened by this! I just think that people saw the ''new'' part of this as relating to the subject''s blue nose, not the photographic style in which the picture was taken. In a different challenge, this would probably attract a higher score. You are obviously fond of capturing bold colour - I particularly like the bucket/mustard experiment. This pic fits in with that, and I hope future ones will too. At the end of the day, take the photos because you enjoy doing it, not because they appeal to someone else, reassuring as that can be.', '2005-01-26 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133003, 137820, 25754, '<td valign="top">Yet another win, you''re unstoppable! Congrats!</td>', 'Yet another win, you''re unstoppable! Congrats!', '2005-01-26 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
