(1133014, 135947, 2741, '<td valign="top">Wow.... I thought this was a blue all the way. Should have finished top 3, but I guess 6th is not that bad. Great job. This is a National Geographic cover in my opinion.</td>', 'Wow.... I thought this was a blue all the way. Should have finished top 3, but I guess 6th is not that bad. Great job. This is a National Geographic cover in my opinion.', '2005-01-26 09:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
