(1133041, 137229, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  I''m developing double vision studying your entry.  Well maybe it''s the wine...  Very creative and great entry for this challenge.  I thought you would enjoy this one.  Congratulations on another ribbon.</td>', 'Nice work!  I''m developing double vision studying your entry.  Well maybe it''s the wine...  Very creative and great entry for this challenge.  I thought you would enjoy this one.  Congratulations on another ribbon.', '2005-01-26 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133045, 137820, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'Great idea!  Congratulations on the blue.', '2005-01-26 10:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133051, 135947, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great tone and feeling.  Well deserved top 10!</td>', 'Great tone and feeling.  Well deserved top 10!', '2005-01-26 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133052, 137820, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I just noticed that I had 358 votes on this one. That number was up to 396 before the close last night, which means at least 38 votes were tossed. I guess a lot of people either didn''t vote 20% or the trolls were out in force. Hey, you missed a couple... what''s with the twos? ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-26 10:33:36.</i></td>', 'Hmm... I just noticed that I had 358 votes on this one. That number was up to 396 before the close last night, which means at least 38 votes were tossed. I guess a lot of people either didn''t vote 20% or the trolls were out in force. Hey, you missed a couple... what''s with the twos? ;-)', '2005-01-26 10:32:49.000000', '2005-01-26 10:33:36.000000', 0),
(1133059, 137820, 15242, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo, Great job setting it up and perfect execution.  Congrats!</td>', 'Amazing photo, Great job setting it up and perfect execution.  Congrats!', '2005-01-26 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133064, 136031, 31760, '<td valign="top">I want to thank everyone for they''re comments this is my first challenge and hope to get better. Thanks again.</td>', 'I want to thank everyone for they''re comments this is my first challenge and hope to get better. Thanks again.', '2005-01-26 10:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133078, 137423, 17203, '<td valign="top">FWIW, this was one of my top ten picks for the challenge (I gave it an 8). Even with your title, I couldn''t tell what the patches of light were, but the effect and soft lighting were very nice. Your color balance is a little off (the stems look blue to me), but a good effort overall. ;-)</td>', 'FWIW, this was one of my top ten picks for the challenge (I gave it an 8). Even with your title, I couldn''t tell what the patches of light were, but the effect and soft lighting were very nice. Your color balance is a little off (the stems look blue to me), but a good effort overall. ;-)', '2005-01-26 10:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133083, 137820, 16106, '<td valign="top">Another amazing set up. Great idea and I think it was a good thing not stopping with the flowers, this is much stronger.</td>', 'Another amazing set up. Great idea and I think it was a good thing not stopping with the flowers, this is much stronger.', '2005-01-26 10:54:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133086, 136970, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>No, really, how is this all the way back here?<br/> <br/>I gave you a ten. I think the shot rocks!<br/> <br/>When I first saw it, it looked like a planet heheh. <br/> <br/>Good job :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'No, really, how is this all the way back here? I gave you a ten. I think the shot rocks! When I first saw it, it looked like a planet heheh.  Good job :) ', '2005-01-26 10:56:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133096, 137322, 23053, '<td valign="top">Undi este Biserica Neagra?<br/> <br/>Sorry, stiu romaneste foarte putin.  Anyway, Brasov is a beautiful place...I was there for a few hours this New Years (and to my dismay, the black church was closed...and it was one of the things I wanted to see the most while in Romania).  Maybe I can visit again in the future.<br/> <br/>Nice shot, by the way.  I like how the smoke stack in the distance looks quite mystical, like it''s made of gold.<br/></td>', 'Undi este Biserica Neagra? Sorry, stiu romaneste foarte putin.  Anyway, Brasov is a beautiful place...I was there for a few hours this New Years (and to my dismay, the black church was closed...and it was one of the things I wanted to see the most while in Romania).  Maybe I can visit again in the future. Nice shot, by the way.  I like how the smoke stack in the distance looks quite mystical, like it''s made of gold.', '2005-01-26 11:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133098, 137387, 28568, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, am inspired to try this technique myself soon :)</td>', 'Fantastic shot, am inspired to try this technique myself soon :)', '2005-01-26 11:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133105, 136037, 16106, '<td valign="top">I thought this would get much closer to ribbons. Disturbing but very well executed.</td>', 'I thought this would get much closer to ribbons. Disturbing but very well executed.', '2005-01-26 11:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133124, 137820, 21711, '<td valign="top">wow Shannon, it seems that you are becoming quite the ribbon collector. great idea on this photo.</td>', 'wow Shannon, it seems that you are becoming quite the ribbon collector. great idea on this photo.', '2005-01-26 11:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133198, 137614, 31311, '<td valign="top">I asked the sun to set low. I placed my back to the light and a contrast formed between the subject''s face and the building across the street. I thought that was quite "innovative" of me.<br/> <br/>Who changed the challenge rules while I wasn''t looking and for whom?<br/> <br/>I gather from the comments that the colorful hat and the title distracted viewers belief that I had no technique in mind, as though the snap were pure luck.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I asked the sun to set low. I placed my back to the light and a contrast formed between the subject''s face and the building across the street. I thought that was quite "innovative" of me. Who changed the challenge rules while I wasn''t looking and for whom? I gather from the comments that the colorful hat and the title distracted viewers belief that I had no technique in mind, as though the snap were pure luck. ', '2005-01-26 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1133213, 137820, 5112, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Congratulations.<br/> <br/>BTW, being that I''m a Cubbie, I''m so glad that Sandberg made it into the Hall of Fame this year.  Yeah!!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-26 11:58:29.</i></td>', 'Cool shot!  Congratulations. BTW, being that I''m a Cubbie, I''m so glad that Sandberg made it into the Hall of Fame this year.  Yeah!!!!', '2005-01-26 11:57:39.000000', '2005-01-26 11:58:29.000000', 0),
