(1133901, 136331, 10275, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say, that this is a great photo. Not all photographs have to be pretty. Sometimes we are after documenting something greater, right? <br/> <br/>Here on DPC, you rarely come across photos from space. People expect photos to be perfect. Yet they seem to totally miss the beauty in imperfection.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Just wanted to say, that this is a great photo. Not all photographs have to be pretty. Sometimes we are after documenting something greater, right?  Here on DPC, you rarely come across photos from space. People expect photos to be perfect. Yet they seem to totally miss the beauty in imperfection. Well done.', '2005-01-26 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
