(1134760, 136731, 29904, '<td valign="top">Matt, I was particualarly impressed by this as it was the only shot I viewed that I did not understand the technique used.  I would love to know how it''s done if you don''t mind sharing!  I think that part of the reason it may have suffered more votes, was because the image was quite small.  And perhaps a less complicated/cluttered subject would have highlighted the technique more?  I hope you play with this more and submit your results!  b</td>', 'Matt, I was particualarly impressed by this as it was the only shot I viewed that I did not understand the technique used.  I would love to know how it''s done if you don''t mind sharing!  I think that part of the reason it may have suffered more votes, was because the image was quite small.  And perhaps a less complicated/cluttered subject would have highlighted the technique more?  I hope you play with this more and submit your results!  b', '2005-01-27 03:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
