(1135548, 135947, 1031, '<td valign="top">I suspected this was a zoo shot even though it is an extremely "realistic" depiction of a natural shot -- it really makes no difference except for your safety. I wish it wasn''t missing quite so much of the left bear, but it''s a (very) minor point. Great work!<br/> <br/>Are you interested in publishing your tritone formula?</td>', 'I suspected this was a zoo shot even though it is an extremely "realistic" depiction of a natural shot -- it really makes no difference except for your safety. I wish it wasn''t missing quite so much of the left bear, but it''s a (very) minor point. Great work! Are you interested in publishing your tritone formula?', '2005-01-27 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
