(1138824, 137817, 24970, '<td valign="top">And....that''s what I get for putting a last-minute (literally) entry in. I knew I''d get hammered on this site for the lack of anything truly in focus. But man, I spent so much time shooting these things I had to enter <i>something</i>. I''m a bit skeptical about the 75 scores of 3 or below though. It''s not beautiful, but how is it that bad? And why didn''t you explain yourselves? <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-10 21:45:56.</i></td>', 'And....that''s what I get for putting a last-minute (literally) entry in. I knew I''d get hammered on this site for the lack of anything truly in focus. But man, I spent so much time shooting these things I had to enter something. I''m a bit skeptical about the 75 scores of 3 or below though. It''s not beautiful, but how is it that bad? And why didn''t you explain yourselves? ', '2005-01-29 14:03:25.000000', '2008-10-10 22:45:56.000000', 0),
