(1206916, 136437, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the intensity of this shot with the colors, the smokiness and the composition.   Really gives a good feel for the atmosphere.  Just watch out for that smoke machine.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-04 00:08:21.</i></td>', 'I really like the intensity of this shot with the colors, the smokiness and the composition.   Really gives a good feel for the atmosphere.  Just watch out for that smoke machine.', '2005-03-04 00:07:59.000000', '2005-03-04 00:08:21.000000', 0),
(1225174, 135841, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed i didn''t comment on this; I gave it a 10. Jackson Pollock with a light pen, is how it looked to me, but the sheer depth of it is palpable. I was surprised it didn''t score much higher...</td>', 'I''m amazed i didn''t comment on this; I gave it a 10. Jackson Pollock with a light pen, is how it looked to me, but the sheer depth of it is palpable. I was surprised it didn''t score much higher...', '2005-03-13 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1232989, 135947, 15766, '<td valign="top">This phot is unbelievable. I couldn''t tell it was a zoo shot but I would love to have been the photographer. <br/> <br/>I know it isn''t luck, it is deserved. When I would get a rare shot I would tell people I was lucky. But after thinking about it, I paid my dues by shooting every chance I got, so I deserved (earned) the photograph.<br/> <br/>Congrats.<br/> <br/>Lenny</td>', 'This phot is unbelievable. I couldn''t tell it was a zoo shot but I would love to have been the photographer.  I know it isn''t luck, it is deserved. When I would get a rare shot I would tell people I was lucky. But after thinking about it, I paid my dues by shooting every chance I got, so I deserved (earned) the photograph. Congrats. Lenny', '2005-03-16 18:20:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1235547, 137429, 35122, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful...well done!!!  10</td>', 'Simply beautiful...well done!!!  10', '2005-03-17 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1246353, 137067, 31606, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  I think this could be improved on if you would get a portrait shot and not landscape.  This way you could get the whole tree.  Maybe even reshoot and back up a little.  I don''t ike how the limbs are cut off in the left and right. Nice colors in the sky.  This would have done better if it was entered in another challenge</td>', 'Nice work.  I think this could be improved on if you would get a portrait shot and not landscape.  This way you could get the whole tree.  Maybe even reshoot and back up a little.  I don''t ike how the limbs are cut off in the left and right. Nice colors in the sky.  This would have done better if it was entered in another challenge', '2005-03-23 18:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
